{"task":"transcribe","language":"english","duration":25.979999542236328,"text":"Flat figures of leather or card, punched and painted, with joints at the arms and thin rods to move them. The player holds them behind a white sheet with a light behind it, and the audience sees only their shadow. One person does all the voices. In Greece, the best-known character is Karaiosis, a poor man with one enormous arm who always gets by on cunning rather than strength.","words":[{"word":"Flat","start":0,"end":0.7599999904632568},{"word":"figures","start":0.7599999904632568,"end":1.2000000476837158},{"word":"of","start":1.2000000476837158,"end":1.600000023841858},{"word":"leather","start":1.600000023841858,"end":1.8200000524520874},{"word":"or","start":1.8200000524520874,"end":2.619999885559082},{"word":"card","start":2.619999885559082,"end":2.619999885559082},{"word":"punched","start":3.200000047683716,"end":3.200000047683716},{"word":"and","start":3.200000047683716,"end":3.7799999713897705},{"word":"painted","start":3.7799999713897705,"end":3.7799999713897705},{"word":"with","start":4.21999979019165,"end":4.460000038146973},{"word":"joints","start":4.460000038146973,"end":4.78000020980835},{"word":"at","start":4.78000020980835,"end":5},{"word":"the","start":5,"end":5.480000019073486},{"word":"arms","start":5.480000019073486,"end":5.480000019073486},{"word":"and","start":5.480000019073486,"end":5.860000133514404},{"word":"thin","start":5.860000133514404,"end":6.239999771118164},{"word":"rods","start":6.239999771118164,"end":6.539999961853027},{"word":"to","start":6.539999961853027,"end":6.840000152587891},{"word":"move","start":6.840000152587891,"end":6.980000019073486},{"word":"them","start":6.980000019073486,"end":7.199999809265137},{"word":"The","start":7.900000095367432,"end":8.0600004196167},{"word":"player","start":8.0600004196167,"end":8.380000114440918},{"word":"holds","start":8.380000114440918,"end":8.760000228881836},{"word":"them","start":8.760000228881836,"end":9.079